Keep a collection of cursed daggers to control where your pet goes.
For example, you can shut Critter (my cat) out of a room with a floating
eye until you have killed and eaten it, or you can force the pet to
stay in a room by dropping a cursed dagger in the doorway (if you want
to see if something else is cursed, and are waiting for Critter to
pick it up). Also good for rooms with lots of food.


